# Workflow State File Format

**File**: `{{workflow.file}}`

## YAML format

Use strictly valid YAML with lowercase keys. Optional lines may be omitted.

```yaml
phase: <current-phase>
issue: <optional-current-issue-id>
tracking: <optional-tracker-prefix> <required-tracker-id>
description: <optional-description>
queue:
  - <optional-queued-issue-id>
```

`phase` is required. Include `issue` for an active change. `tracking` is required
only when transitioning issue tracking; its tracker identifier is required, while
its tracker prefix is optional. Omit `queue` when it is empty.

## Instructions

- Update `{{workflow.file}}` whenever workflow state changes.
- Use the `send_file_content` MCP tool to send the complete file content after every update.
